/-!
# Witnesses for 4,725 distinct cosets of the fixed J₂ subgroup

Each parameter encodes a representative index and one of the 128 checked
subgroup words. Thus every entry factors as `a * representative i` with
`a ∈ Seed.s`. The proposed binary image codes are strictly increasing;
`Ordering` verifies this and `KeyChecks` checks every value.

Source: the retained `Placement/source/double-cosets.json` and the fixed
ATLAS generators. `source/generate.py` discovers and sorts these witnesses;
no external assertion of exhaustiveness or distinctness is used as a proof.
-/

